+Spec refs: REQ-CAPSTONE-4810, SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-4810,
+SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-4810-BLOCKED-PRECONDITION,
+SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-4810-FIELD-PRINCIPLES.
